
# Resource Pack Application

---
This modpack comes with &aa lot of resourcepacks&r for you to use! Most of them should be enabled by default thanks to &lResource Pack Overrides&r, but they don't always work perfectly. If you find yourself needing to do something manually - 

We recommend enabling all of them, except for the following:
- Fresh Animations (a spider and phantom-free version is already enabled!)
- Fresh Animations All Extensions (a spider and phantom-free version is already enabled!)
- Black Icons
- Twilight Classic
- Classic Icons
- Create Legacy Copper
- Quark Programmer Art
- Programmer Art
- Darker Ropes
- White Icons

The order in which you enable the resourcepacks &ashould not matter&r, as they are &dedited to be compatible with one another&r.
            